Compact-ICC-Profiles — bundled sRGB output-intent profile

PlumePDF's PDF/A output-intent support (`src/PlumePdf/Documents/PdfA/OutputIntentBuilder.cs`)
embeds one small, ready-to-use ICC destination profile as a compiled-in package asset
(`src/PlumePdf/Assets/sRGB-v2-micro.icc`, 456 bytes) so a caller can produce a PDF/A-1B or
PDF/A-2B document's mandatory `/OutputIntents` entry without supplying their own profile.

